Replicaset
k create/apply/delete -f <filename>
k scale rs <rsname> --replicas=numberofreplicas
k api-resources => get k8s resources with their shortname and api version
k get/edit/delete <rsname>


Deployment
k create deploy <deployname> --image=<image> --replicas 
k create deploy <deployname> --image=<image> --replicas --dry-run=client -o yaml > <filename>
k get/edit/delete/describe deploy
k create/apply/delete -f <filename>

